      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Producing and consuming events from message brokers and then exposing them to others using WebHook, WebSocket, GraphQL, gRPC, etc., is just a piece of cake using Ballerina. You focus on the business logic and let Ballerina focus on the network logic.</p>\n",
